'''Ends of the Earth''' (オワーリ大陸 ''Owāri Tairiku'', '''Conclusion Continent''') is the 47th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Not very hard compared to the previous sub-chapters. There are no [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] or [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], only early-mid-[[Stories of Legend|SoL]] enemies. However, don't take these stages too lightly, as some require lots of skill or luck. The hardest stages are probably [[Final Tower]] and [[Apocalypse Temple]].
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

