==Trivia==
*Ends of the Earth's Japanese name, Owāri Tairiku (オワーリ大陸), is a pun on 終わりたい ''owaritai'' (want to end) and 大陸 ''tairiku'' (continent). [[PONOS Campaigns|PONOS]] [https://twitter.com/nyansi_nitijo/status/974639394417123328 drew attention to this] during the [https://www.youtube.com/live/CNzkjynJ0Q4 March 16th, 2018 livestream], with both it and the stages' names foreshadowing the end of [[Stories of Legend]] in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]], released exactly 1 month later on April 16th, 2018.

